# MailAgent — main endpoints. Generated skeleton, synthetic data only.
# Path ids below are placeholders — replace with real ids from a list call.
@rule = 1
@sender = 1
# Variables: see rest/http-client.env.json (host, session, xsrf). How to get them: docs/guides/api.md
# Full list of MailAgent operations: /api/docs (tag "MailAgent").

### GET /api/mail/status — mail.status
GET {{host}}/api/mail/status
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### POST /api/mail/sync — POST /api/mail/sync → {data: counters}; not connected → 422, reconnect_required → 409
POST {{host}}/api/mail/sync
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/

### GET /api/mail/messages — mail.messages
GET {{host}}/api/mail/messages
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### GET /api/mail/rules — mail.rules.index
GET {{host}}/api/mail/rules
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

